§ `S 362/2001 reg 4: Rg 7 First Schedule (item 3 deleted from 21 January 2000; items 6 and 7 changed, from 1 August 2001)`
-- 1999 Edition First Schedule: 1 Scanning Receivers; 2 Military Communication Equipment; 3 Scramblers, Speech Invertors, On-line Cyphering Equipment; 4 Telephone Voice Changing Equipment; 5 Automatic Call Diverters; 6 Cordless Telephone (CT1); 7 Wireless Surveillance Video Camera; 8 Radio-communication Jamming Devices.
-- S 362/2001 reg 4: (a) deletes item 3; (b) deletes item 6 and substitutes "Radio-communication Equipment operating in frequency bands 890-915 MHz and 935-960 MHz except Cellular Mobile phones or such other equipment approved by the Authority"; (c) deletes item 7.
#ASSERT count (`Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) First Schedule: the equipment named`) EQUALS 8
#ASSERT count (`Rg 7 First Schedule with item 3 deleted (reg 4(a) of S 362/2001, deemed from 21 January 2000) and items 6 and 7 as in the 1999 Edition: the equipment named`) EQUALS 7
#ASSERT count (`Rg 7 First Schedule as amended by S 362/2001 (1 August 2001): the equipment named`) EQUALS 6
#ASSERT elem "Scramblers, Speech Invertors, On-line Cyphering Equipment" (`Rg 7 (1999 Ed.) First Schedule: the equipment named`)
#ASSERT NOT (elem "Scramblers, Speech Invertors, On-line Cyphering Equipment" (`Rg 7 First Schedule as amended by S 362/2001 (1 August 2001): the equipment named`))
#ASSERT NOT (elem "Scramblers, Speech Invertors, On-line Cyphering Equipment" (`Rg 7 First Schedule with item 3 deleted (reg 4(a) of S 362/2001, deemed from 21 January 2000) and items 6 and 7 as in the 1999 Edition: the equipment named`))
#ASSERT elem "Radio-communication Equipment operating in frequency bands 890-915 MHz and 935-960 MHz except Cellular Mobile phones or such other equipment approved by the Authority" (`Rg 7 First Schedule as amended by S 362/2001 (1 August 2001): the equipment named`)
#ASSERT NOT (elem "Wireless Surveillance Video Camera operating in frequency bands 890-915MHz and 935-960MHz" (`Rg 7 First Schedule as amended by S 362/2001 (1 August 2001): the equipment named`))
#ASSERT NOT (elem "Cordless Telephone (CT1) operating in frequency bands 890-915MHz and 935-960MHz" (`Rg 7 First Schedule as amended by S 362/2001 (1 August 2001): the equipment named`))
#ASSERT elem "Radio-communication Jamming Devices operating in any frequency band" (`Rg 7 First Schedule as amended by S 362/2001 (1 August 2001): the equipment named`)
